# Secrets files - DO NOT COMMIT actual secrets
# dot_secrets.tmpl is safe to commit - it uses 1Password templates, not actual secrets
*.secrets
# Note: Actual .secrets files should never be committed
# The dot_secrets.tmpl uses 1Password CLI to fetch secrets at runtime

